WEBVTT

00:00:00.510 --> 00:00:01.800
Come here quickly!

00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:03.020
Come here immediately!

00:00:03.020 --> 00:00:04.720
Let the three of us play 'til we drop!

00:00:14.420 --> 00:00:17.020
Say bye-bye to the teacher after class!

00:00:17.020 --> 00:00:19.530
And bring back your gym clothes!

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:24.400
Wanna gather at the schoolyard to play?

00:00:24.430 --> 00:00:27.160
Aren't you gonna give a good excuse?

00:00:27.170 --> 00:00:29.710
Just leave that homework alone!

00:00:29.710 --> 00:00:34.700
Let's swing around the metal bars instead!

00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:39.770
That red backpack sure is strong

00:00:39.770 --> 00:00:42.350
One, two, line up in threes!

00:00:42.350 --> 00:00:44.880
And dash forward with the pencil case after school!

00:00:44.880 --> 00:00:49.950
You'll forget about it, so cheer up!

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:49.950
One

00:00:49.650 --> 00:00:49.950
Two!

00:00:49.950 --> 00:00:52.470
Hey Mr.! Turn around that corner!

00:00:52.470 --> 00:00:56.760
Let's have a large assembly in the schoolyard!

00:00:57.410 --> 00:00:59.100
Just who am I?

00:00:59.570 --> 00:01:04.990
Can I still have fun when I grow up?

00:01:04.990 --> 00:01:09.700
I don't know, but I just wanna know!

00:01:09.700 --> 00:01:15.060
If we can still laugh over the small matters

00:01:15.060 --> 00:01:19.660
I'm happy enough with that!

00:01:19.690 --> 00:01:22.340
This! That! And everything else!

00:01:22.480 --> 00:01:27.200
Let the three of us play 'til we drop!

00:01:30.020 --> 00:01:35.030
Hats and Underwear

00:01:30.020 --> 00:01:35.030
Go on Your Head<i>!?</i>

00:01:35.820 --> 00:01:42.620
The Night Before The Athletic Meet

00:01:44.910 --> 00:01:48.370
EXIT GATE

00:01:50.950 --> 00:01:50.990
Admission Gate

00:01:54.150 --> 00:01:56.400
Kamohashi Elementary School

00:01:56.690 --> 00:01:59.710
Exit Gate

00:01:59.510 --> 00:02:01.890
What are you doing there?!

00:02:01.890 --> 00:02:04.220
You're up to no good, aren't you?!

00:02:04.220 --> 00:02:06.430
Whatever you're doing at an elementary school at such a late hour,

00:02:06.430 --> 00:02:08.560
I will have you provide a valid explanation at the station!

00:02:08.560 --> 00:02:09.850
Y-You've got it all wrong!

00:02:09.850 --> 00:02:12.150
I'm watching over my daughter!

00:02:12.150 --> 00:02:13.610
Papa!

00:02:13.610 --> 00:02:15.360
Papa!

00:02:15.360 --> 00:02:17.190
Papa...?

00:02:17.190 --> 00:02:18.360
I'm the Papa.

00:02:18.360 --> 00:02:21.120
He really is my papa!

00:02:21.120 --> 00:02:22.870
I really am the papa.

00:02:22.870 --> 00:02:24.950
Those two hardly resemble each other.

00:02:24.950 --> 00:02:26.360
That's awfully suspicious.

00:02:28.250 --> 00:02:30.790
Damn them, always making judgments on my disheveled looks...

00:02:30.790 --> 00:02:32.920
Since when did you get here, Papa?

00:02:32.920 --> 00:02:33.960
Futaba!

00:02:33.960 --> 00:02:36.710
You aren't supposed to be out this late by yourself!

00:02:36.710 --> 00:02:39.050
I-I'm sorry.

00:02:39.050 --> 00:02:41.720
But, once I think about tomorrow's athletic meet,

00:02:41.720 --> 00:02:43.850
I just couldn't sit still and wait for it!

00:02:44.720 --> 00:02:45.680
Come here!

00:02:45.680 --> 00:02:47.350
Papa, you come over as well!

00:02:52.690 --> 00:02:55.730
I thought of doing a rehearsal, you know.

00:02:55.730 --> 00:02:57.360
Rehearsal?

00:02:57.360 --> 00:02:59.950
Will you accompany me in this, Papa?

00:02:59.950 --> 00:03:02.400
Guess I can't say no to it.

00:03:13.540 --> 00:03:16.460
She's going to start from the admission and opening ceremony, eh?

00:03:26.100 --> 00:03:28.320
Time for the athlete's pledge of honor!

00:03:29.390 --> 00:03:30.350
Eh?

00:03:30.350 --> 00:03:31.520
I do it?

00:03:31.520 --> 00:03:33.520
That's right!

00:03:35.310 --> 00:03:37.270
T-Teacher!

00:03:37.270 --> 00:03:40.110
In the name of sportsmanship,

00:03:40.110 --> 00:03:43.570
we vow to compete fair and square and with integrity!

00:03:43.570 --> 00:03:46.240
Now, a speech by the Head Principal!

00:03:46.240 --> 00:03:47.870
A-Am I doing that as well?

00:03:51.330 --> 00:03:53.250
Eh... erm...

00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:55.540
May it be a lucky day today...

00:03:55.540 --> 00:03:57.130
And well, about that...

00:03:57.130 --> 00:03:59.000
Please try your best!

00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:00.050
Yes!

00:04:00.800 --> 00:04:05.760
An obstacle race, tug-of-war, and cavalry battle?

00:04:05.760 --> 00:04:07.470
Are you going to go for relay racing, too?

00:04:07.470 --> 00:04:08.600
Yup!

00:04:08.600 --> 00:04:10.930
The obstacle course seems to be the first event!

00:04:10.930 --> 00:04:12.270
Well then, I'm going for it!

00:04:12.270 --> 00:04:13.770
Bang!

00:04:13.770 --> 00:04:14.770
You say, "bang?!"

00:04:14.770 --> 00:04:15.730
Oh!

00:04:26.570 --> 00:04:29.080
I suppose this would work as the balance beam.

00:04:30.040 --> 00:04:31.040
Ah!

00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:33.540
I have to set the goal tape up as well?!

00:04:34.170 --> 00:04:35.540
Goal!!!

00:04:36.130 --> 00:04:38.000
I ranked first!

00:04:38.630 --> 00:04:40.300
You did very well.

00:04:40.300 --> 00:04:41.960
You're amazing!

00:04:44.380 --> 00:04:46.300
Next up is tug-of-war!

00:04:46.300 --> 00:04:48.390
Ah, so... Where is the rope?

00:04:50.810 --> 00:04:52.770
It would be me?!

00:04:55.350 --> 00:04:57.100
That was an overwhelming victory!

00:04:57.980 --> 00:04:59.730
Y-You did a great job.

00:04:59.730 --> 00:05:01.980
Please pat me in praise!

00:05:01.980 --> 00:05:04.400
That was really admirable of you!

00:05:06.030 --> 00:05:08.820
I will be the calvary-lead!

00:05:08.820 --> 00:05:10.790
Aren't I heavy?

00:05:10.790 --> 00:05:12.500
Not really.

00:05:13.330 --> 00:05:16.080
And now, I'll be the anchor for the relay race!

00:05:16.080 --> 00:05:17.500
Oh?

00:05:17.500 --> 00:05:18.880
Get ready!

00:05:18.880 --> 00:05:20.420
Bang!

00:05:57.540 --> 00:05:58.710
Oh crap!

00:05:58.710 --> 00:06:00.420
I'm supposed to hold the goal-tape!

00:06:01.710 --> 00:06:02.590
She's fast!

00:06:02.590 --> 00:06:03.840
Ah darn.

00:06:03.840 --> 00:06:06.630
As her parent, as her father...

00:06:06.630 --> 00:06:09.470
I must not let my daughter beat me!

00:06:25.440 --> 00:06:27.280
D-Damn it!

00:06:27.650 --> 00:06:28.860
Are you alright?!

00:06:28.860 --> 00:06:30.240
Oi, Futaba?!

00:06:30.240 --> 00:06:33.990
That was a decisive lead! We got the blue ribbon easily!

00:06:44.340 --> 00:06:46.630
It was the blue ribbon...

00:06:46.630 --> 00:06:49.260
We did get first place, you know.

00:06:49.260 --> 00:06:52.090
She really is still just a kid, huh?

00:06:53.600 --> 00:06:55.470
What are you doing here?!

00:06:59.440 --> 00:07:01.650
Please just let me be already...!

00:07:05.230 --> 00:07:07.360
Good luck!

00:07:13.410 --> 00:07:14.910
The calvary battle...

00:07:14.910 --> 00:07:17.160
What a meaningless competition!

00:07:17.160 --> 00:07:18.290
Come on now!

00:07:18.290 --> 00:07:21.460
Let's go get some enemy caps with gusto, alright?

00:07:21.460 --> 00:07:22.630
That's no good.

00:07:22.630 --> 00:07:24.880
Let us observe the overall situation,

00:07:24.880 --> 00:07:26.300
and go where enemies are thinning out!

00:07:26.300 --> 00:07:28.510
I want to grab some caps right away!

00:07:28.510 --> 00:07:30.170
I want to get into a chicken fight!

00:07:30.170 --> 00:07:32.680
Don't move like that all of sudden!

00:07:30.170 --> 00:07:32.680
C'mon, let's get moving already!

00:07:39.520 --> 00:07:43.230
The ground is so far away...

00:07:43.230 --> 00:07:46.650
I'm so unlucky!

00:07:46.650 --> 00:07:48.940
We're the ones who are unlucky.

00:07:49.990 --> 00:07:52.910
Enemies, please come this way!

00:07:52.910 --> 00:07:55.780
We will have a match fair and square!

00:07:57.450 --> 00:08:00.330
W-Why don't they come over?

00:08:00.330 --> 00:08:02.710
Don't run away!

00:08:02.710 --> 00:08:06.790
We are in the blind spot of the enemies by our precise positioning!

00:08:06.790 --> 00:08:10.090
More like, they're not coming just because they don't want to be cursed!

00:08:10.920 --> 00:08:13.340
I have a hunch that someone is summoning me!

00:08:13.340 --> 00:08:15.050
I want my enemy caps!

00:08:15.050 --> 00:08:18.720
I want them enemy caps already! I want a lot of them!

00:08:18.720 --> 00:08:21.100
For a horse, you're pretty noisy and annoying.

00:08:21.100 --> 00:08:22.810
We're not going to be of much use, anyway.

00:08:23.230 --> 00:08:24.900
See there!

00:08:26.480 --> 00:08:29.780
It hurts! Let go of me!

00:08:29.780 --> 00:08:32.780
I'm sorry! I mistook this as the hat!

00:08:32.780 --> 00:08:34.700
It must be nice to be Micchan.

00:08:34.700 --> 00:08:36.240
It seems like she's having fun.

00:08:36.240 --> 00:08:41.120
Rather than just stealing the caps, she's having fun in inflicting pain to others.

00:08:41.120 --> 00:08:44.160
She's also being cruel to her allies, that Mitsuba!

00:08:44.160 --> 00:08:45.170
That hurts!

00:08:45.170 --> 00:08:46.920
It hurts!

00:08:46.920 --> 00:08:48.040
Who said what?

00:08:48.040 --> 00:08:49.090
Did you say something about me?

00:08:49.090 --> 00:08:53.420
Please do not use my eyebrows as a steering wheel!

00:08:53.420 --> 00:08:57.510
Sugisaki and Miya-something said that you were a rotten heretic!

00:08:57.510 --> 00:08:58.390
Hey-

00:08:58.390 --> 00:09:00.390
It's Miyashita! Mi-ya-shi-ta!

00:09:00.390 --> 00:09:03.390
And I never said anything just now!

00:09:06.100 --> 00:09:07.940
Just look here!

00:09:08.440 --> 00:09:11.400
I got this many caps!

00:09:11.400 --> 00:09:13.820
I'm sure this will lead us to victory, no?

00:09:13.820 --> 00:09:18.620
Oh? Don't tell me that you guys still haven't even gotten a single one?

00:09:19.740 --> 00:09:22.120
You better feel grateful to me, then!

00:09:23.370 --> 00:09:25.410
You folks were pretty worked up about this, too.

00:09:25.410 --> 00:09:28.130
You're rather unlucky, aren't you, Futaba?

00:09:28.130 --> 00:09:32.590
Along with that unmotivated Hitoha, you have to deal with those two lame horses, huh?

00:09:32.590 --> 00:09:34.630
God damn you, Mitsuba...!

00:09:35.670 --> 00:09:37.590
Futaba?

00:09:39.640 --> 00:09:41.100
Caps...

00:09:41.100 --> 00:09:42.560
Ah, caps and caps...!

00:09:42.560 --> 00:09:44.560
More and more...!

00:09:44.560 --> 00:09:46.020
A lot of caps!

00:09:46.020 --> 00:09:48.850
Lots!

00:09:50.610 --> 00:09:53.110
Hah? What are you doing?!

00:09:53.110 --> 00:09:56.320
Please take a good look at us! We are your allies!

00:09:56.320 --> 00:09:59.660
Hey, j-just calm down a bit, now...!

00:10:01.120 --> 00:10:03.290
She sees nothing but caps...!

00:10:03.290 --> 00:10:06.710
The athletic meet, like an aphrodisiac, has made Futaba mad with desire!

00:10:07.080 --> 00:10:10.250
Quit spouting nonsense and just stop her already!

00:10:11.170 --> 00:10:13.380
Let's go already.

00:10:13.380 --> 00:10:14.380
Wait-

00:10:14.380 --> 00:10:15.960
Don't move any farther!

00:10:15.960 --> 00:10:17.550
This'll be good, Futaba!

00:10:17.550 --> 00:10:18.800
Go steal them!

00:10:18.800 --> 00:10:21.010
That Mitsuba does make me somewhat irked now!

00:10:21.010 --> 00:10:22.220
Don't come near me!

00:10:22.220 --> 00:10:23.510
What the heck is wrong with you?!

00:10:23.510 --> 00:10:25.770
No! I'm going to fall and die!

00:10:29.690 --> 00:10:31.310
I'm going to die.

00:10:31.310 --> 00:10:33.440
I'm going to die! I'm going to die right now!

00:10:35.280 --> 00:10:37.530
Go for it, Futaba!

00:10:45.160 --> 00:10:47.200
Those damned hyenas!

00:10:47.200 --> 00:10:48.910
It's so scary!

00:10:48.910 --> 00:10:51.210
I'm so scared!

00:10:51.210 --> 00:10:52.290
You're wrong!

00:10:52.290 --> 00:10:53.710
I'm a parent!

00:10:53.710 --> 00:10:55.550
Everyone does say that, you know...

00:10:55.550 --> 00:10:57.800
The hard work of my daughters...

00:10:57.800 --> 00:10:59.550
I want to see the results of their perseverance!

00:11:03.430 --> 00:11:05.470
We have finally cornered you now, Mitsuba!

00:11:05.470 --> 00:11:08.100
Just pass over those caps obediently!

00:11:11.060 --> 00:11:12.770
The enemy caps are...

00:11:12.770 --> 00:11:13.400
gone?!

00:11:13.980 --> 00:11:15.150
You fools....

00:11:15.150 --> 00:11:18.110
Did you think that I would let you seize away my winning achievements that easily?!

00:11:23.200 --> 00:11:26.410
Micchan, you don't really have so much bust.

00:11:26.410 --> 00:11:27.580
Shut up!

00:11:27.580 --> 00:11:28.950
More importantly, just let go of me!

00:11:28.950 --> 00:11:31.580
Why do I always have to face these troubles?!

00:11:32.000 --> 00:11:34.130
Micchan, you're lacking virtues too.

00:11:34.130 --> 00:11:36.590
I don't want to hear that from you!

00:11:36.590 --> 00:11:41.130
At any rate, the only way to stop Futaba is to hand over your caps.

00:11:41.130 --> 00:11:43.430
Even a couple is fine, so you should surrender some over.

00:11:43.430 --> 00:11:44.510
Why's that?!

00:11:44.510 --> 00:11:47.010
These are the achievements that I earned by my own hands, you know!

00:11:47.010 --> 00:11:48.930
Is this really the time to say that?

00:11:51.640 --> 00:11:53.440
Alright, I get it!

00:11:53.440 --> 00:11:55.810
Just a couple, then. Just take a couple of them, okay?!

00:12:02.150 --> 00:12:06.330
Why are you taking all of them?!

00:12:06.330 --> 00:12:07.830
Ok, I got them, more or less.

00:12:07.830 --> 00:12:08.910
Third Daughter has taken them!

00:12:08.910 --> 00:12:09.910
All of them?!

00:12:09.910 --> 00:12:11.910
If you try for it, you really can do swell, can't ya?

00:12:11.910 --> 00:12:14.040
I just got a better opinion about you now.

00:12:19.340 --> 00:12:21.090
Hold- Quit it!

00:12:21.090 --> 00:12:22.010
Stop!

00:12:22.010 --> 00:12:22.800
Stop it now!

00:12:22.800 --> 00:12:25.470
My achievements are...!

00:12:25.470 --> 00:12:26.220
Stop!

00:12:26.220 --> 00:12:27.640
Stop already, Futaba!

00:12:27.640 --> 00:12:28.560
Spit them out!

00:12:28.560 --> 00:12:30.180
Throw them up already!

00:12:30.180 --> 00:12:31.060
You oaf!

00:12:40.860 --> 00:12:42.860
Halfway point?

00:12:42.400 --> 00:12:45.610
Mr. Yabe collapsed in the middle of class due to a fever.

00:12:46.870 --> 00:12:46.950
Study Hall

00:12:49.910 --> 00:12:52.660
Anyway, Yabecchi's class is always just so boring.

00:12:52.660 --> 00:12:54.410
It's nice to have some Study Hall sessions occasionally!

00:12:57.580 --> 00:12:59.800
Yesterday's Idol Athletic Meet...

00:12:59.800 --> 00:13:02.460
was really the best of them all, huh?

00:13:02.460 --> 00:13:05.180
There's nothing really interesting about Study Hall, though.

00:13:05.180 --> 00:13:07.420
... Since the class makes such a ruckus during these sessions.

00:13:10.560 --> 00:13:13.140
I wish he would just recover quickly.

00:13:20.900 --> 00:13:22.820
W-Whatever are you doing...?!

00:13:22.820 --> 00:13:24.610
Ah, Third Daughter?

00:13:24.610 --> 00:13:27.860
I'm in the midst of writing this sutra on Yabecchi's body, you see.

00:13:27.860 --> 00:13:29.990
Since Yabecchi suddenly fell like that,

00:13:29.990 --> 00:13:33.370
he must've been possessed by something of an evil nature!

00:13:34.960 --> 00:13:38.880
I've always felt strange about it.

00:13:38.880 --> 00:13:41.630
Often, there are many items broken and whatnot, for example.

00:13:41.630 --> 00:13:43.710
Then, there are so many folks getting injured, too.

00:13:43.710 --> 00:13:45.590
He must be under a curse!

00:13:45.590 --> 00:13:47.090
I'm so sorry.

00:13:47.090 --> 00:13:48.390
As the younger sister...

00:13:48.390 --> 00:13:50.850
It's not your fault at all, Third Daughter!

00:13:50.850 --> 00:13:54.680
Although you certainly do seem to draw in spirits fairly easily from your work and all...

00:13:54.680 --> 00:13:55.730
More importantly, though.

00:13:55.730 --> 00:13:58.440
By your call, as the genius, pretty girl spirit-medium,

00:13:58.440 --> 00:14:00.810
how would you evaluate Yabecchi's conditions?

00:14:01.520 --> 00:14:04.190
I would assume that he's tired.

00:14:04.190 --> 00:14:06.400
He's been possessed, just as I thought, eh?!

00:14:04.860 --> 00:14:07.490
Possessed

00:14:06.400 --> 00:14:07.490
Oh damn!

00:14:08.410 --> 00:14:09.660
At any rate,

00:14:09.660 --> 00:14:11.200
it's prep-time for exorcising!

00:14:12.280 --> 00:14:14.160
Time to continue onwards!

00:14:14.160 --> 00:14:15.870
What is this?

00:14:15.870 --> 00:14:17.660
This ritual...

00:14:18.830 --> 00:14:20.460
Matsuoka.

00:14:20.460 --> 00:14:23.960
If we don't write the sutra all over his body, we won't be able to complete the exorcism, right?

00:14:24.710 --> 00:14:26.380
Alright!

00:14:26.380 --> 00:14:27.840
There it goes!

00:14:35.100 --> 00:14:36.480
Alright, come now!

00:14:36.480 --> 00:14:38.890
Next up is his back!

00:14:38.890 --> 00:14:40.100
Third Daughter!

00:14:40.100 --> 00:14:42.650
Help me turn him over!

00:14:42.650 --> 00:14:44.480
I'm going back to the classroom now.

00:14:44.480 --> 00:14:46.490
Hey! What about the exorcism?!

00:14:46.490 --> 00:14:49.110
If it stays this way... At this rate, Yabecchi will die!

00:14:56.160 --> 00:14:57.580
Third Daughter!

00:14:57.580 --> 00:14:59.120
Nice assist!

00:15:00.420 --> 00:15:04.040
He <i>will</i> really die if he fell on his head like that, you know.

00:15:04.040 --> 00:15:06.380
This is also the doing of the malicious spirit, isn't it?!

00:15:06.380 --> 00:15:09.160
Don't go blaming your mistakes on random spirits like that.

00:15:12.090 --> 00:15:14.010
What an incredible fever!

00:15:14.010 --> 00:15:14.920
It seems like a cold.

00:15:19.230 --> 00:15:21.810
Why did you use a water-based pen to write with?!

00:15:21.810 --> 00:15:24.310
It'd be troublesome if it wouldn't come off, right?

00:15:26.980 --> 00:15:30.150
I realized my mistake from the past!

00:15:31.820 --> 00:15:34.240
Someone's coming over!

00:15:35.330 --> 00:15:37.290
L-Lock the door!

00:15:37.290 --> 00:15:38.160
Yes, ma'am!

00:15:38.160 --> 00:15:40.060
That'd be a nuisance to the exorcism, right?

00:15:43.170 --> 00:15:44.160
Eh?

00:15:44.160 --> 00:15:45.170
It won't open.

00:15:48.590 --> 00:15:51.170
Wh-Where's his boxers?

00:15:51.170 --> 00:15:54.470
Is it necessary to have Yabecchi's boxers?

00:15:55.970 --> 00:15:57.260
Wait, just a second!

00:16:04.350 --> 00:16:06.150
Oh, Hitoha.

00:16:06.150 --> 00:16:08.150
Have you been there all this time?

00:16:08.150 --> 00:16:10.570
I'm sorry, but I'm already alright, so...

00:16:10.570 --> 00:16:13.160
